<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47729" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θᾰλᾰμ-ιός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span> (oxyt., <i><span class="en">
			Arc.
			40.13
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or
				<i>belonging to the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλαμος</span>: an Subst.,
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλαμιός, ὁ</span>,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλαμίτης</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.32
			</span></i> (gen. pl., perh. fr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλαμίας</span>), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1052
			</span></i> (dub.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλαμιά</span>, 
				Ion.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιή</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώπη</span>), ἡ, <i>the oar of
				the</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλαμίτης</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				553
			</span></i> (pl.): pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1604.55
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀπή</span>) <i>the hole in the ship's side,
				through which this oar worked</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ
				θαλαμιῆς διελεῖν τινα</span> to place a man so that his
			upper half projected through <i>this hole</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.33
			</span></i>: metaph., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				1232
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
